  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a 2022 statement, Joannie Chin described NIST Engineering Laboratory research on designing more efficient HVAC systems, commissioning them, and detecting operational faults to save energy. She also said the laboratory is exploring how artificial intelligence can automatically optimize building operations.",
